## Model card

- **Name:** GPT-5.6 Sol (OpenAI; hyphenated vendor style; "Max" variant surfaced on Artificial Analysis)
- **Short description:** OpenAI's GPT-5.6 Sol reasoning model (succeeded by newer GPT-6 Sol in AA tracking), positioned for agentic/reasoning workloads with large context. Proprietary.
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI and cloud/provider surfaces (OpenAI, Azure, Amazon Bedrock listed on OpenRouter); served via OpenRouter as `openai/gpt-5.6-sol`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-07-09 (per Artificial Analysis). Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated on fetched sources.
- **IDs:** `openai/gpt-5.6-sol` (OpenRouter). No free-tier ID verified.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens (per Artificial Analysis). Max output not explicitly specified on fetched pages.
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output. Reasoning yes (AA lists as reasoning model). Tool use supported (OpenRouter advertises tools/tool_choice).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Varies by provider/tier on OpenRouter (examples shown from ~$2/$10 to ~$8/$40 per 1M input/output; see model page). AA comparison summary lists $4.00 / 1M input and $20.00 / 1M output. Paid pricing.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary (parameter count and detailed architecture not publicly disclosed).

